  <div class="modal-back" data-close></div>
  <div class="modal-card" role="document">
    <button class="modal-x" data-close aria-label="Close">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="modal-kicker">For the class of 2027</div>
    <h2 id="amTitle">The SAT is required again.</h2>
    <p>More than <b>60 colleges</b> have reinstated a testing requirement for the 2027 cycle &mdash; including <b>six of the eight Ivy League schools</b>, with Columbia joining by 2027.</p>
    <p class="modal-sub">Families who spent four years hearing &ldquo;test-optional&rdquo; now have a score to plan for, and junior year is the window to do it in.</p>
    <div class="modal-acts">
      <a class="btn btn-a shimmer" href="#start" data-close><span>Book the free diagnostic</span></a>
      <button class="btn btn-b" data-close>Not right now</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

