<section id="instructor"><div class="shell">
  <div class="instr">
    <div class="pic rv"><img src="Portrait.jpg" alt="Luca Moretti" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="rv d1">
      <div class="lbl">Your instructor</div>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(1.55rem,2.9vw,2.2rem);margin-top:.65rem;line-height:1.16">Luca Moretti &mdash; founder, and the person who teaches every session.</h2>
      <p style="margin-top:1.15rem;font-size:.96rem;max-width:56ch">Generic tutoring explains tonight&rsquo;s assignment and expires the moment the hour ends. Every plan here starts with a real diagnostic, adapts as a student improves, and is backed by a private portal &mdash; adaptive practice, a weak-spot tracker, and a running log of every missed question &mdash; so we are always working on exactly what is costing points.</p>
      <div class="creds">
        <span>Northwestern University, B.A. Statistics &mdash; in three years</span>
        <span>Dean&rsquo;s List</span>
        <span>1500+ SAT</span>
        <span>5 on AP Calculus AB &amp; BC</span>
        <span>IB Diploma</span>
        <span>Listed with Summit Public Schools</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gbox">
        <div class="k">The guarantee</div>
        <h3>If the score doesn&rsquo;t improve, we keep teaching. Free.</h3>
        <p>Complete the program &mdash; every session and the assigned homework &mdash; and if your student&rsquo;s official score doesn&rsquo;t improve from their diagnostic baseline, we keep working at no additional charge until it does. No family is asked to keep paying for a result that hasn&rsquo;t arrived.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

